  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical support to the Mauritius National Audit Office (NAO)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project links the Mauritius NAO (M-NAO) with the UK NAO to provide technical support and capacity building that will increase the quality, regularity, and analysis of M-NAO&apos;s reports on government operations, and the organisation&apos;s ability to hold central government account for financial decision-making.</narrative>
  </description>
